# What a device base takes from device-template: the device layer on top of idealkb (the parts contract's records and
# the phone's queries). Listed so that a base can follow them like idealkb's generic files (bin/follow.sh, run from a
# clone of this repository that holds the release tag). The template has no releases yet, so nothing follows this list
# yet: idealkb's backlog follow-source-from-pin (update-pins reading its source from the pin file) and releases here
# come first. A base keeps a file as its own by naming it in its idealkb.toml, as for idealkb's.
queries/phone-queue.sql
queries/phone-next.sql
queries/parts.sql
records/part.sql
records/device.sql
records/backlog-status.sql
records/backlog-needs.sql
records/test-run.sql
